{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063007/block/singleImage/3263136/df/1597308180_ZP.jpg?updatedAt=1794298532\"/><figcaption>藍田啟田大廈七旬婦墮樓，保安揭發送院不治。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (10 日 ) 中午 12 時 16 分，警方接獲藍田啓田道 59 號啓田大廈保安報案，指發現一名女子倒臥在上址一平台，懷疑她從高處墮下。 人員接報到場，該名 73 歲姓邱女子昏迷被送往基督教聯合醫院治理，其後被證實死亡。經初步調查，相信事主從上址一單位墮下。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.644499+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:15:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:19.979046+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:14.964280+00:00","content_hash":"58eae49685147dbeaa4288cf45c7e5735e88948d0f12807759f66afa3e50be55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.644499+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}